          "relation": "implies",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 470,
            "text": "theorem prefix_integral_propagate {f g : ℝ → ℝ} {a r : ℝ} (har : a ≤ r)\n    (hf : IntegrableOn f (Ioc 0 r)) (hg : IntegrableOn g (Ioc 0 r))\n    (head : (∫ x in Ioc 0 a, f x) = ∫ x in Ioc 0 a, g x)\n    (tail : ∀ x, a < x → f x = g x) :\n    (∫ x in Ioc 0 r, f x) = ∫ x in Ioc 0 r, g x"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
